1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,752
To get past the wall you need chemistry: reflux rectified spirit with quicklime, which takes up the water as calcium hydroxide, and distil.

2
00:00:09,752 --> 00:00:12,877
That gives absolute alcohol, one hundred percent.

3
00:00:12,877 --> 00:00:17,031
Industry uses azeotropic distillation with benzene.

4
00:00:17,031 --> 00:00:21,210
And never calcium chloride, which forms a compound with ethanol.

